cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this software, please cite it as below."
title: "FAIR curation on the VAST Data Platform"
abstract: >-
  A working demonstration of automated FAIR curation: research data written to VAST over S3 or NFS is
  profiled and described by a VAST DataEngine function, reviewed by a person, and published with RO-Crate
  and Croissant metadata, an identifier, a landing page, a snapshot and a measured FAIR score.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Snow
    given-names: Chris
    affiliation: VAST Data
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/vast-data/fair-demo"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-04
keywords:
  - FAIR data
  - research data management
  - metadata
  - RO-Crate
  - Croissant
  - VAST Data
